#### Data Flow:
- All feeds push data to Redis using pub/sub channels
- Backend subscribes to Redis channels and computes signals
- Backend pushes computed signals to frontend via Socket.IO
- Every data point must have a millisecond timestamp for the UI

#### Error Handling:
- Auto-reconnect on WebSocket disconnection (exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, max 30s)
- Fallback: If Binance WS fails, poll CoinGecko REST API every 2 seconds
- If Polymarket RTDS fails, use Binance price as approximation (flag on UI as "estimated")
- Log all connection events and errors

